\title{The signature of a domain wall}
\date{2026-11-27}

\p{Cut a periodic square lattice into two strips and keep the links across both cuts. Each strip has an oriented boundary, even though the whole lattice has none. Which parts of the sign count can be assigned to the strips and which require the links between them?}
